wtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" class=\"iframe_placeholder\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" fill=\"none\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a data-donate=\"false\" href=\"https://umigamestudios.itch.io/highschool-j/purchase\" class=\"button donate_btn\">Download Now</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h3><em>An ordinary life buried under debt and unspoken poems... Until a transfer student arrives, bringing a presence impossible to resist.&quot;</em></h3>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h4>Full Game is coming soon... Check out the Steam Page!</h4>\r\n<h2><a style=\"font-size: inherit\" href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5111980/Highschool_J/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">STEAM</a></h2>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>Set against the humid, fluorescent nights of modern Japan,&nbsp;<strong>Highschool J</strong>&nbsp;is a psychological visual novel exploring emotional detachment, existential dread, and divine decay<sup></sup>.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>You play as&nbsp;Yuki, an exhausted high schooler hiding behind sunglasses, struggling under suffocating debt from a wrecked club room, and running clandestine midnight courier deliveries for Taehyun, a local pawnshop owner<sup></sup>. Your world is narrow, quiet, and kept alive only by Mei, your fiercely loyal childhood friend<sup></sup>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>Then comes&nbsp;J. She sits in the back row, detached from the classroom, indifferent to pain, bleeding silently from her hands<sup style=\"\"></sup><strong>. </strong>What starts as a single gesture in a school hallway pulls you into an underground labyrinth of strange packages, rotting shadows, and a bond forged through transference<sup></sup>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Content Warning</strong></h3>\r\n<p><em>Highschool J contains psychological horror elements, flashing visuals/glitch effects, unsettling audio, brief depictions of blood, and discussions of illness.</em></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_8813516\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"25 September 2026 @ 14:17 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 4 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 8 total ratings\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" tabindex=\"0\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" content=\"5.0\" class=\"star_value\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 5.0 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"width: 100.00000%\" class=\"star_fill\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><s